ive stress: OGG1 expression and arsenic exposure, nail selenium, and skin hyperkeratosis in Inner Mongolia</article-title><source>Environ. Health Perspect</source><year>2006</year><volume>114</volume><fpage>835</fpage><lpage>841</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16759981</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b14-ijerph-06-01107"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="book"><source>International classification of diseases, 10th revision</source><publisher-name>World Health Organization</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Geneva, Switzerland</publisher-loc><year>2006</year></citation></ref><ref id="b15-ijerph-06-01107"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hoyert</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Heron</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Murphy</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kung</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Deaths: Final data for 2003</article-title><source>National vital statistics reports; Technical report</source><publisher-name>National Center for Health Statistics</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Atlanta, GA, USA</publisher-loc><year>2006</year></citation></ref><ref id="b16-ijerph-06-01107"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gong</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Lu</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Watta</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Wena</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Hea</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Mumford</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ning</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Xia</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Le</surname><given-names>XC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Speciatio